COMPILATION OF: E46L1

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program
S: Symbol Table List

  SYMBOLS:

BLOCK AT LINE 1, AUTO STORAGE 0 BYTES
a 0000 E46L1 ENTRY PARAMETERS(0) EXTERNAL CONSTANT
BLOCK AT LINE 3, AUTO STORAGE 21 BYTES
c 0000 OUTF FILE EXTERNAL STATIC
c 0000 V CHAR(20) VARYING AUTOMATIC
   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E46L1

   1 a 0000 E46L1:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 c 0006   dcl outf file, v char(20) varying;
   4 c 0006   open file(outf) stream output title('L1OUT DAT');
   5 c 0023   put file(outf) list(v);
   6 c 003B   put list(v);
   7 c 0050   close file(outf);
   8 a 0056 end E46L1;

